      "file": "poppler/Page.cc",
      "function": "Page::loadStandaloneFields",
      "line": null,
      "code": "FormField *field = Form::createFieldFromDict (Object(annot->getDict()), annot->getDoc(), r, nullptr, &parents);",
      "note": "The standalone-field path wraps `annot->getDict()` in `Object(...)`, creating another owning `Object` for the same dictionary without calling `copy()` or otherwise incrementing the dict refcount. The shared dictionary is now owned by more `Object` instances than its refcount records. The fix replaces this with `annot->getAnnotObj().copy()`, which increments the refcount correctly.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
